            <ArticleTitle>Evaluation of efficacy of nizer versus nimesulide tablets in otitis media.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>619</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An evaluation of clinical efficacy of nizer versus nimesulide tablets was undertaken in 118 patients suffering from otitis media. Nizer demonstrated rapid and powerful analgesic and antipyretic effects compared to plain nimesulide, without additional side effects.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
